"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3904880","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1226260-1846651706691773","game_id":"steam-1226260","kind":"announcement","title":"DIY Store On Steam Next Fest!","summary":"You heard me right! My demo is part of Steam Next Fest, so come check it out!I’m working hard to make the best DIY store simulator. It’s been a fun journey bringing this game to you!The demo has been out for a while, and I’ve taken your ideas, reviews, and everything else you’ve said about the game and put them into development. And I’d love to hear even more!Nothing shapes a game better than its players. I hope this event is the perfect chance to play the demo for the first time, or to come bac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:25:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691773","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1226260-1840944183776538","game_id":"steam-1226260","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO IS OUT!","summary":"Hello, shopkeepers!It happened. DIY Shop Simulator DEMO is out! 🛠️🎉Your very own hardware store is finally open. Only catch: those shelves are definitely not going to stock themselves. You start with a humble little shop and a suspicious amount of empty space. Time to grab some products from the warehouse, figure out where everything goes, set your prices, and brace yourself for your very first customers.Then comes the fun (and sometimes slightly chaotic) part: selling, reinvesting, and slowly t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T12:00:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1226260-1840944183773926","game_id":"steam-1226260","kind":"announcement","title":"Tomorrow, We Open the Store! (DEMO)","summary":"Hey, future shopkeepers! 🖐️Tomorrow's the big day. DIY Shop Simulator DEMO is finally out. I may or may not be nervously hovering over the launch button as we speak. Your warehouse is waiting, the shelves need filling, and someone has to decide whether that drill is worth the price tag. What are you stocking first? Power tools, paint, or enough cement to build the entire neighborhood? Don't forget to add DIY Shop Simulator to your wishlist and join us tomorrow!The store is waiting. 🔨","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T13:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773926","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1226260-1840310314352178","game_id":"steam-1226260","kind":"announcement","title":"The Shelves Are Almost Stocked! (DEMO)","summary":"Hey, shopkeepers!The wait is almost over. DIY Shop Simulator launches in just 3 days! 🎉 The shelves are waiting, the warehouse is filling up, and there's a whole store to build.Soon you’ll be stocking shelves, fiddling with prices, serving your first customers, and probably discovering that running a shop is harder than it looks. Good luck turning that tiny hardware store into something you’re proud of. 🫡If you haven’t wishlisted DIY Shop Simulator yet, now’s a great time. It genuinely helps us ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T17:30:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352178","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1226260